# "When you play another land": a second City of Traitors played on turn 3 is another land for the first, which is
# sacrificed, but not for itself, so one City stays.

[Bot1 Deck]
City of Traitors
City of Traitors
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.City of Traitors.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.City of Traitors.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = City of Traitors
Bot1.Graveyard = City of Traitors
